# Azure OpenAI credentials for the LangGraph agent (src/mocolens/agent/).
# From your Foundry project's Overview page at ai.azure.com: the API key and the Azure
# OpenAI endpoint. Paste the endpoint as shown - https://<resource-name>.openai.azure.com/,
# with or without /openai/v1/ on the end, all work. A standalone Azure OpenAI resource's
# "Keys and Endpoint" page in the Azure Portal works too.
# Optional: AZURE_OPENAI_DEPLOYMENT, if your deployment is not named gpt-5.4-mini.
AZURE_OPENAI_API_KEY=
AZURE_OPENAI_ENDPOINT=https://<your-resource-name>.openai.azure.com/
